# "Faeries you control": Bot2's Faerie Miscreant enters under Bot2's control while Jean-Luc is Bot1's, so it gets no counters
# at all (CR 614.12) and stays a 1/1. Bot1's own Faerie, entering on turn 3 with Jean-Luc the only other creature Bot1
# controls, gets exactly one counter for each of his two types (Human, Officer) and is a 3/3.

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Mox Sapphire
Mox Ruby
Mox Pearl
Jean-Luc, Mon Capitaine
Faerie Miscreant
Island x12

[Bot2 Deck]
Island
Faerie Miscreant
Island x12

